                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-04-12"><hi rendition="#italic">April 12,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Gresham instructs Mr. Thompson to request that the restrictions on commercial
                    cipher telegrams be removed.</p>
